# The node power heat map and the power report: turn on "Show Node Power" on allflame_exp_048 (Flicker Strike) and wait for the report (CalcsTab:BuildPower, resumed once per tree draw, yielding every 100 ms of work), open the power report list, change the character level with the heat map on (a recalc, then the whole report again), then the same heat map on a minion build (allflame_exp_032, Raise Spectre).
screen 1920 1080
fixture userdir=../fixtures/user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_048.xml"
frames 4
wait-idle
step heat_map
move 1615 1066
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
wait-power 3000
expect-power
step power_report_list
move 1228 1066
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 1100 500
frames 3
expect-text "Hide Power Report"
step level_change_rebuild
move 928 14
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
expect-recalc
wait-power 3000
expect-power
step heat_map_minion
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_032.xml"
frames 4
expect-recalc
move 1615 1066
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
wait-power 3000
expect-power
